ac:Provide exact commands and native Windows outputs proving the cause or ruling out each plausible cause; cite primary Microsoft documentation; recommend the smallest identity-safe correction that preserves no-replace and held-root semantics; attach findings to the board and hand them to the active developer. No product edits, merge, tag, or release.
