.research/260729_curator-go-to-csk-parity-delta.md:242:Curator review history shows why native Windows is mandatory: cross-compilation passed while later native runs found lock identity, DACL, journal durability, and GC containment defects. CocoaSkills should budget native Windows review cycles from the start.
