183572-+backend compares the inspected directory generation at the held parent
183573-+descriptor, renames through that descriptor, and verifies the quarantined
183574-+inode before deletion. A concurrent entry replacement is restored or retained,
183575-+while a concurrent root replacement leaves the new namespace untouched. The
183576-+Windows backend reopens and records the verified file identity, then uses
183577:+`SetFileInformationByHandle(FileRenameInfo)` with the held quarantine directory
183578-+handle so the rename acts on that exact object without replacing a destination.
