435334-+### Runtime orphan compatibility
435335-+
435336-+Orphan matching is limited to manager-owned legacy and indexed temporary and
435337-+backup names plus indexed stale names. PID and allocation indexes must use the
435338-+canonical numeric shape. Live-PID entries and malformed, leading-zero, or
435339-+unrelated dotfiles are retained; only exact dead-PID names are swept.
435340-+
