435351-+The previously accepted currentness behavior was preserved: marker-v1 schemas
435352-+1–5, raw-snapshot and static-context replanning, complete target/toolchain/
435353-+execution-policy cache identity, protected receipt/artifact and shim checks,
435354-+result-only capability evidence, and normal-install rebuild/repair remain
435355-+unchanged by this rework.
