457487-+### Exact protected-object retirement
457488-+
457489-+The POSIX collector carries the classified directory state into quarantine,
457490-+selects it through the held driver descriptor, and verifies the quarantined
457491-+inode before deletion. A pathname exchange is restored or retained; a driver
457492-+root exchange can sweep only the entry reached through the previously held
457493-+root descriptor and never the new live root.
457494-+
