457496-+the selected source with `DELETE`, and renames that exact open handle with
457497:+`SetFileInformationByHandle(FileRenameInfo)`. The destination is relative to
457498-+the already-held quarantine directory, and replacement is disabled. Entry and
457499-+root exchange tests plant a valid young replacement between classification and
457500-+retirement and assert that it remains a cache hit.
