462376-+The previously accepted currentness behavior was preserved: marker-v1 schemas
462377-+1–5, raw-snapshot and static-context replanning, complete target/toolchain/
462378-+execution-policy cache identity, protected receipt/artifact and shim checks,
462379-+result-only capability evidence, and normal-install rebuild/repair remain
462380-+unchanged by this rework.
