471818-+
471819-+## Provenance
471820-+
471821-+- Task: `TASK-260720-th0jdi` — Implement build currentness, repair, and GC.
471822-+- Recorded clean base and merge base: `07655553cebcf867bbe58629de98e77644606c85`.
471823-+- Previously reviewed head: `f3c1254e4fe7958c720cbef096a4ef00103d43a2`.
471824:+- Rework head: `0314ab5939b51cf33f0fdbb68c9df90631e84f5a`.
