493867-+
493868-+## Provenance
493869-+
493870-+- Task: `TASK-260720-th0jdi` — Implement build currentness, repair, and GC.
493871-+- Recorded clean base and merge base: `07655553cebcf867bbe58629de98e77644606c85`.
493872-+- Previously reviewed head: `f3c1254e4fe7958c720cbef096a4ef00103d43a2`.
493873:+- Rework head: `0314ab5939b51cf33f0fdbb68c9df90631e84f5a`.
