514734-+  [`FILE_RENAME_INFORMATION`](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows-hardware/drivers/ddi/ntifs/ns-ntifs-_file_rename_information)
514735-+  contract states that rename acts on the supplied file handle, requires
514736-+  `DELETE` access, can resolve a relative name through a held root-directory
514737-+  handle, and fails on an existing target when replacement is false. It also
