519451-+# TASK-260720-th0jdi — Review rework evidence (RUN-260801-a7ef1b)
519452-+
519453-+## Provenance
519454-+
519455-+- Task: `TASK-260720-th0jdi` — Implement build currentness, repair, and GC.
519456-+- Recorded clean base and merge base: `07655553cebcf867bbe58629de98e77644606c85`.
519457-+- Previously reviewed head: `f3c1254e4fe7958c720cbef096a4ef00103d43a2`.
519458:+- Rework head: `0314ab5939b51cf33f0fdbb68c9df90631e84f5a`.
519459-+- `git verify-commit HEAD` exited `0` with a good ECDSA signature for `oparin@me.com`.
