519597-+requires at least one valid marker in every group. A vanished generation group,
519598-+an unreadable journal or marker, or a concurrent generation change makes the
519599-+entire mark phase uncertain and suppresses runtime, snapshot, and build sweeps.
519600-+This prevents a valid marker from one project, global, or hybrid target from
519601-+masking the loss of another in-flight target.
519602-+
