519608-+Windows backend reopens and records the verified file identity, then uses
519609:+`SetFileInformationByHandle(FileRenameInfo)` with the held quarantine directory
519610-+handle so the rename acts on that exact object without replacing a destination.
519611-+Native backend tests exchange entries and driver roots between classification
519612-+and retirement and assert that young replacements are never deleted.
519613-+
519614-+Runtime orphan cleanup recognizes only the manager-owned legacy and indexed
519615-+temporary/backup names and indexed stale names. PID liveness remains the sweep
519616-+gate; malformed, leading-zero, or unrelated dotfile names are retained.
