- The failure is isolated to Win32’s relative `RootDirectory` call path, consistent with [Microsoft’s 2022 implementation warning](https://github.com/MicrosoftDocs/sdk-api/commit/ada04eef90bc7ebe441ce2ef938867d3a677d57d).
- Recommended correction: [`NtSetInformationFile`](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows-hardware/drivers/ddi/ntifs/nf-ntifs-ntsetinformationfile), class 10, retaining the verified held root and no-replace semantics.

